      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Magnificent 4 bedroom detached family residence situated at the heart of Tenure, Dunleer, Co. Louth. Upon arrival you will appreciate the wonderful atmosphere created by its present owners with the entire house tastefully decorated and maintained to an excellent standard throughout. The accommodation consists of light filled rooms that are well-proportioned, and are complimented outside by the large landscaped gardens to the front & rear, including a private west facing rear aspect. With easy access to Drogheda Town Centre within 15 minute's drive & the M1 Motorway less than 8 minutes, this is a quality home ideal for any purchaser who requires a property tastefully finished and ready to go. To appreciate this truly magnificent family residence, viewing is essential.\n\nAMV - 595,000 For Sale by Private Treaty\n\nFeatures \n4 Bedroom Detached Property\nBuilt C. 2004\nExtends to C. 209 sq.m. (2,250 sq.ft.)\nViews over Adjacent Countryside\nPVC Double Glazing Throughout\nO-F-C-H - High Efficiency Boiler\nSolid Fuel Stove Flush Fitted\nZoned Heating Controls\nWater Mains Supply\nWaste Mains Connection\nWest Facing Rear Orientation \nFully Private Aspects\nLarge Landscaped Gardens\nRaised Planter Beds \nRear Patio Seating Area\nVehicular Side Access\nExternal Electric Sockets & Water Tap\nStira Staircase to Attic Storage \nPartially Floored Attic Storage\nElectric Security Gates & Tarmac Drive\nFully Fenced Perimeter\nDetached Block Built Roller Shutter\n\nAccommodation Includes \nEntrance Hall\nGuest WC(1.80m x 1.18m) \nSitting Room(6.42m x 3.95m) \nLiving Room(4.56m x 3.53m)\nKitchen(7.71m x 4.82m)\nUtility Room(2.70m x 2.30m)\nSunroom(4.52m x 3.50m) \n\n1st Floor\nLanding \nBedroom 1(6.90m x 3.95m)\nEn Suite(2.15m x 1.75m)\nDressing Room(2.36m x 2.10m) \nBedroom 2(4.54m x 3.54m) \nBedroom 3(3.55m x 2.95m) \nBedroom 4(3.51m x 2.37m)\nMain Bathroom(3.13m x 2.70m) \n\nBuilding Energy Rating\nBER: B3\nBER No. 111540829\nEnergy Performance Indicator: 136.74 kWh/m²/yr\n\nViewing Details \nStrictly by appointment with the sole selling agent.\n\n"
